{"id":117020342702668,"name":"Foresters 🌳 [RELEASE]","desc":"Foresters 🌳 \n\nGrab your axe and become a legendary lumberjack! Chop, saw and sell your way across an open world in this chill, grindy lumber adventure.\n\nHow to Chop\n• Hold down on a tree to wind up your swing\n• Let go when the ring is full for a powerful first hit!\n• Dots appear on the trunk. Click each one as the closing ring meets it; it's okay to miss a few!\n• Fill the notch to yell \"Timber!\" and bring the tree down\n• Carry your wood to a sawmill for a perfect cut, then sell it to a merchant for Bucks!\n\nPlease like and favorite the game. The game is in very early beta so expect bugs.\n\nInspired by Fisch and Lumber Tycoon.","path":"/game/117020342702668-foresters","slug":"117020342702668-foresters","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4443de2c5ac9938e9bdda43fdd9622377ba1b51fdb7ff8c11dd944ffa8f7f6e0.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b3d8957d80e2675aeb86da06251c2c82/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":224,"visitor":422088,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-19T13:56:36.985Z","creator":{"name":"fader's trees","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6ad4b4fdcb44a0cfb14344af","title":"[KEYLESS]  - Auto Everything","game":{"_id":"6ad4b4fdcb44a0cfb14344ae","gameId":117020342702668,"name":"Foresters 🌳 [RELEASE]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9bbd054f4d7ac0affa5c54b9d844b044ee906f5efe5a38024d1ed4cdc4266dca.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-42926703c4d62116354538559c3d1ff3-a75a762352da.png"},"slug":"117020342702668-foresters","path":"/game/117020342702668-foresters","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9bbd054f4d7ac0affa5c54b9d844b044ee906f5efe5a38024d1ed4cdc4266dca.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-42926703c4d62116354538559c3d1ff3-a75a762352da.png"},"placeId":117020342702668},"slug":"Foresters-RELEASE-KEYLESS